        claim: "PR #191 proves liminf (e_BB+2s_C)/D >= 0.99554058458... with a qualitative endpoint gap"
        reason: "the cavity/train proof depends on the rejected cyclic inward-cap detour; the later scalar audit does not repair this missing premise"
        depends_on:
          - "C-CYCLIC-CAP-DETOUR"
